I definitions.inc

# pull：fetch 段失败直接透传，merge 段不执行（全程零改动）
# 远程仓造一个 master 提交后，把指针文件删掉模拟"远程无此分支"
C remote
> init
<<<
+ r.txt mcur.txt
> add r.txt
<<<
> commit "remote work"
<<<

C
> init
<<<
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

# 远程名未注册（换一个没登记过的名字）：fetch 的失败消息逐字透传
> pull upstream master
Remote directory not found.
<<<

# 删掉远程 master 指针，制造"远程没有该分支"
- remote/.gitlet/refs/heads/master

> pull origin master
That remote does not have that branch.
<<<

# 两次失败都不产生远程跟踪指针，本地分支也无任何变化（仍只 initial）
* .gitlet/refs/remotes/origin/master
* .gitlet/refs/remotes/upstream/master
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
